    "notes": "Reference layout A: node lanes with time flowing down. The frame chip sits on the arrow and carries the speed as its fill.",
    "html": "<section class=\"slide content\" data-screen-label=\"15\" data-label=\"Zniffer · lanes\" data-speaker-notes=\"Reference layout A: node lanes with time flowing down. The frame chip sits on the arrow and carries the speed as its fill.\">\n    <div class=\"board\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"corner tl\"></i><i class=\"corner tr\"></i><i class=\"corner bl\"></i><i class=\"corner br\"></i></div>\n    <div class=\"kicker k-right\">Reference · Lane view</div>\n    <h2 class=\"slide-title\">Zniffer: lane view</h2>\n\n    <div class=\"zgrid\" style=\"left: var(--pad-x); top: 336px; width: 1680px; height: 216px; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 528px);\">\n      <div class=\"zc figure-frame\"><i class=\"corner tl\"></i><i class=\"corner tr\"></i><i class=\"corner bl\"></i><i class=\"corner br\"></i>\n        <div class=\"zc-head\"><span class=\"zc-id\"><b>1</b> Controller</span><span class=\"zc-role\">Z-Wave JS</span></div>\n        <div class=\"zc-acts\">\n          <button class=\"zc-btn is-primary\" type=\"button\">Basic Set</button>\n          <button class=\"zc-btn\" type=\"button\">Ping node 3</button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"zc-out ok\"><i></i>ACK <em>13 ms</em></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"zc figure-frame\"><i class=\"corner tl\"></i><i class=\"corner tr\"></i><i class=\"corner bl\"></i><i class=\"corner br\"></i>\n        <div class=\"zc-head\"><span class=\"zc-id\"><b>2</b> Plug</span><span class=\"zc-role\">Repeater</span></div>\n        <div class=\"zc-acts\">\n          <button class=\"zc-btn is-primary\" type=\"button\">On</button>\n          <button class=\"zc-btn\" type=\"button\">Off</button>\n          <div class=\"zc-seg\"><span class=\"on\">Route via</span><span>Direct</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"zc-out ok\"><i></i>Report <em>received</em></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"zc figure-frame\"><i class=\"corner tl\"></i><i class=\"corner tr\"></i><i class=\"corner bl\"></i><i class=\"corner br\"></i>\n        <div class=\"zc-head\"><span class=\"zc-id\"><b>3</b> Remote</span><span class=\"zc-role\">Destination</span></div>\n        <div class=\"zc-acts\">\n          <button class=\"zc-btn\" type=\"button\">Trigger report</button>\n          <div class=\"zc-seg\"><span>Jam off</span><span class=\"on\">Jam on</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"zc-out wait\"><i></i>Waiting <em>—</em></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"zn figure-frame\" style=\"position: absolute; left: var(--pad-x); top: 576px; width: 1104px; height: 384px;\"><i class=\"corner tl\"></i><i class=\"corner tr\"></i><i class=\"corner bl\"></i><i class=\"corner br\"></i>\n      <div class=\"zn-bar\"><span>Lane view</span><span class=\"meta\">home id 0xe1f4a2c9 · exchange 07</span></div>\n      <div class=\"zn-fig\">\n        <svg class=\"zl\" viewBox=\"0 0 1020 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Zniffer lane view: a routed Basic Set from node 1 to node 3 through repeater node 2, followed by routed acknowledgments\">\n          <defs>\n            <marker id=\"zlA15\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5.5\" markerHeight=\"5.5\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10Z\" fill=\"var(--color-accent-900)\"></path></marker>\n          </defs>\n          <text class=\"lane\" x=\"180\" y=\"20\">NODE 1</text><text class=\"lane-sub\" x=\"180\" y=\"44\">CONTROLLER</text>\n          <text class=\"lane\" x=\"500\" y=\"20\">NODE 2</text><text class=\"lane-sub\" x=\"500\" y=\"44\">PLUG · REPEATER</text>\n          <text class=\"lane\" x=\"820\" y=\"20\">NODE 3</text><text class=\"lane-sub\" x=\"820\" y=\"44\">REMOTE</text>\n          <text class=\"hdr\" x=\"66\" y=\"44\" text-anchor=\"end\">MS</text>\n          <rect class=\"band\" x=\"-20\" y=\"68\" width=\"1060\" height=\"56\"></rect>\n          <path class=\"band-rule\" d=\"M-20 68H1040M-20 124H1040\"></path>\n          <g>\n            <path class=\"arw\" d=\"M188 96H480\" marker-end=\"url(#zlA15)\"></path>\n            <rect class=\"chip f-100\" x=\"228\" y=\"78\" width=\"224\" height=\"36\"></rect>\n            <text class=\"cl on\" x=\"340\" y=\"104\">ROUTED DATA</text>\n            <text class=\"tm\" x=\"66\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text>\n            <text class=\"tm\" x=\"66\" y=\"104\">.0</text>\n          </g>\n          <g>\n            <path class=\"arw\" d=\"M508 152H800\" marker-end=\"url(#zlA15)\"></path>\n            <rect class=\"chip f-40\" x=\"548\" y=\"134\" width=\"224\" height=\"36\"></rect>\n            <text class=\"cl\" x=\"660\" y=\"160\">ROUTED DATA</text>\n            <text class=\"tm\" x=\"66\" y=\"160\" text-anchor=\"end\">+4</text>\n            <text class=\"tm\" x=\"66\" y=\"160\">.1</text>\n          </g>\n          <rect class=\"band\" x=\"-20\" y=\"180\" width=\"1060\" height=\"56\"></rect>\n          <path class=\"band-rule\" d=\"M-20 180H1040M-20 236H1040\"></path>\n          <g>\n            <path class=\"arw ack\" d=\"M812 208H520\" marker-end=\"url(#zlA15)\"></path>\n            <rect class=\"chip k\" x=\"548\" y=\"190\" width=\"224\" height=\"36\"></rect>\n            <rect class=\"sw-40\" x=\"551\" y=\"193\" width=\"18\" height=\"30\"></rect>\n            <text class=\"cl\" x=\"671\" y=\"216\">ROUTED ACK</text>\n            <text class=\"tm\" x=\"66\" y=\"216\" text-anchor=\"end\">+9</text>\n            <text class=\"tm\" x=\"66\" y=\"216\">.8</text>\n          </g>\n          <g>\n            <path class=\"arw ack\" d=\"M492 264H200\" marker-end=\"url(#zlA15)\"></path>\n            <rect class=\"chip k\" x=\"228\" y=\"246\" width=\"224\" height=\"36\"></rect>\n            <rect class=\"sw-100\" x=\"231\" y=\"249\" width=\"18\" height=\"30\"></rect>\n            <text class=\"cl\" x=\"351\" y=\"272\">ROUTED ACK</text>\n            <text class=\"tm\" x=\"66\" y=\"272\" text-anchor=\"end\">+13</text>\n            <text class=\"tm\" x=\"66\" y=\"272\">.2</text>\n          </g>\n          <path class=\"life\" d=\"M180 60V296M500 60V296M820 60V296\"></path>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"zn-side\" style=\"left: 1272px; top: 576px; width: 528px;\">\n      <h3>Lane view</h3>\n      <p>One lane per node, newest exchange at the bottom. Every hop is one arrow, so a routed frame takes as many arrows as it takes hops.</p>\n      <ul>\n        <li><span class=\"sp sp-9\">9.6k</span><span class=\"sp sp-40\">40k</span><span class=\"sp sp-100\">100k</span><span class=\"sp sp-lr\">LR</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"zn-type\">DATA</span> filled chip · transmitted</li>\n        <li><span class=\"zn-type is-ack\">ACK</span> outlined chip · acknowledged</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p style=\"margin: 18px 0 0;\">Chip fill is the speed. Timestamps run from the first frame of the exchange; RSSI and channel belong in the frame log, not here.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"page-foot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n  </section>"
  },
  {
    "number": 16,
    "title": "Zniffer · frame log",
    "notes": "Reference layout B: one row per frame, hops left to right. The lower panel is the simple variant with no repeaters and no RSSI.",
    "html": "<section class=\"slide content\" data-screen-label=\"16\" data-label=\"Zniffer · frame log\" data-speaker-notes=\"Reference layout B: one row per frame, hops left to right. The lower panel is the simple variant with no repeaters and no RSSI.\">\n    <div class=\"board\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"corner tl\"></i><i class=\"corner tr\"></i><i class=\"corner bl\"></i><i class=\"corner br\"></i></div>\n    <div class=\"kicker k-right\">Reference · Frame log · Hop list</div>\n    <h2 class=\"slide-title\">Zniffer: frame log, hop list</h2>\n\n    <div class=\"zc figure-frame\" style=\"position: absolute; left: var(--pad-x); top: 336px; width: 528px; height: 216px;\"><i class=\"corner tl\"></i><i class=\"corner tr\"></i><i class=\"corner bl\"></i><i class=\"corner br\"></i>\n      <div class=\"zc-head\"><span class=\"zc-id\"><b>1</b> Controller</span><span class=\"zc-role\">Z-Wave JS</span></div>\n      <div class=\"zc-acts\">\n        <button class=\"zc-btn is-primary\" type=\"button\">Turn plug on</button>\n        <button class=\"zc-btn\" type=\"button\">Off</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"zc-out ok\"><i></i>ACK <em>13 ms · 2 hops</em></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"zc figure-frame\" style=\"position: absolute; left: var(--pad-x); top: 576px; width: 528px; height: 216px;\"><i class=\"corner tl\"></i><i class=\"corner tr\"></i><i class=\"corner bl\"></i><i class=\"corner br\"></i>\n      <div class=\"zc-head\"><span class=\"zc-id\"><b>2</b> Plug</span><span class=\"zc-role\">Repeater</span></div>\n      <div class=\"zc-acts\">\n        <button class=\"zc-btn\" type=\"button\">Trigger report</button>\n        <div class=\"zc-seg\"><span class=\"on\">Jam off</span><span>Jam on</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"zc-out bad\"><i></i>No ACK <em>after 3 tries</em></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"zn-side\" style=\"left: var(--pad-x); top: 804px; width: 528px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px;\">Node order stays fixed per exchange; the arrow carries the direction, so an ACK reads back along the same path.</p>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0;\">The hop list is the ultra-compact frame log: direct frames only, so path collapses to one arrow and RSSI, channel and time drop out.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"zn figure-frame\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 696px; top: 336px; width: 1104px; height: 380px;\"><i class=\"corner tl\"></i><i class=\"corner tr\"></i><i class=\"corner bl\"></i><i class=\"corner br\"></i>\n      <div class=\"zn-bar\"><span>Frame log</span></div>\n      <div class=\"zn-log\">\n        <div class=\"zn-hd zn-cols-full\"><span>#</span><span>Time</span><span>Path · direction</span><span>Frame</span><span>Speed</span><span>RSSI</span><span>Ch</span></div>\n        <div class=\"zn-r zn-cols-full\">\n          <span class=\"zn-seq\">01</span><span class=\"zn-t\">0.0</span>\n          <span class=\"zn-chain\"><span class=\"zn-nd tx\">1</span><span class=\"zn-hop\">→</span><span class=\"zn-nd rx\">2</span><span class=\"zn-hop dim\">→</span><span class=\"zn-nd idle\">3</span></span>\n          <span class=\"zn-type\">ROUTED DATA</span><span class=\"sp sp-100\">100k</span>\n          <span class=\"rssi\"><b><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i></i></b>−52</span><span class=\"zn-ch\">0</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"zn-r zn-cols-full\">\n          <span class=\"zn-seq\">02</span><span class=\"zn-t\">4.1</span>\n          <span class=\"zn-chain\"><span class=\"zn-nd idle\">1</span><span class=\"zn-hop dim\">→</span><span class=\"zn-nd tx\">2</span><span class=\"zn-hop\">→</span><span class=\"zn-nd rx\">3</span></span>\n          <span class=\"zn-type\">ROUTED DATA</span><span class=\"sp sp-100\">100k</span>\n          <span class=\"rssi\"><b><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i></i><i></i></b>−61</span><span class=\"zn-ch\">0</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"zn-r zn-cols-full is-ack\">\n          <span class=\"zn-seq\">03</span><span class=\"zn-t\">9.8</span>\n          <span class=\"zn-chain\"><span class=\"zn-nd idle\">1</span><span class=\"zn-hop dim\">←</span><span class=\"zn-nd rx\">2</span><span class=\"zn-hop\">←</span><span class=\"zn-nd tx\">3</span></span>\n          <span class=\"zn-type is-ack\">ROUTED ACK</span><span class=\"sp sp-100\">100k</span>\n          <span class=\"rssi\"><b><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i></i><i></i></b>−58</span><span class=\"zn-ch\">0</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"zn-r zn-cols-full is-ack\">\n          <span class=\"zn-seq\">04</span><span class=\"zn-t\">13.2</span>\n          <span class=\"zn-chain\"><span class=\"zn-nd rx\">1</span><span class=\"zn-hop\">←</span><span class=\"zn-nd tx\">2</span><span class=\"zn-hop dim\">←</span><span class=\"zn-nd idle\">3</span></span>\n          <span class=\"zn-type is-ack\">ROUTED ACK</span><span class=\"sp sp-100\">100k</span>\n          <span class=\"rssi\"><b><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i></b>−49</span><span class=\"zn-ch\">0</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"zn figure-frame\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 696px; top: 744px; width: 1104px; height: 216px;\"><i class=\"corner tl\"></i><i class=\"corner tr\"></i><i class=\"corner bl\"></i><i class=\"corner br\"></i>\n      <div class=\"zn-bar\"><span>Hop list</span></div>\n      <div class=\"zn-log\">\n        <div class=\"zn-r zn-cols-lite\">\n          <span class=\"zn-seq\">01</span>\n          <span class=\"zn-chain\"><span class=\"zn-nd tx\">1</span><span class=\"zn-hop\">→</span><span class=\"zn-nd rx\">2</span></span>\n          <span class=\"zn-type\">DATA</span><span class=\"sp sp-100\">100k</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"zn-r zn-cols-lite is-ack\">\n          <span class=\"zn-seq\">02</span>\n          <span class=\"zn-chain\"><span class=\"zn-nd rx\">1</span><span class=\"zn-hop\">←</span><span class=\"zn-nd tx\">2</span></span>\n          <span class=\"zn-type is-ack\">ACK</span><span class=\"sp sp-100\">100k</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"zn-r zn-cols-lite\">\n          <span class=\"zn-seq\">03</span>\n          <span class=\"zn-chain\"><span class=\"zn-nd tx\">3</span><span class=\"zn-hop\">→</span><span class=\"zn-nd rx\">1</span></span>\n          <span class=\"zn-type\">DATA</span><span class=\"sp sp-40\">40k</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"page-foot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n  </section>"
