    "html": "<section class=\"slide content\" data-screen-label=\"17\" data-label=\"Quarters · capture + waterfall\" data-speaker-notes=\"The full demo layout: controls across the top, the capture in two modules, the RF waterfall CLI beside it at 2:1 or taller.\">\n    <div class=\"board\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"corner tl\"></i><i class=\"corner tr\"></i><i class=\"corner bl\"></i><i class=\"corner br\"></i></div>\n    <div class=\"kicker k-right\">Reference · full layout</div>\n    <h2 class=\"slide-title\">Controls, capture, waterfall</h2>\n\n    <div class=\"zgrid\" style=\"left: var(--pad-x); top: 336px; width: 1680px; height: 144px; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);\">\n      <div class=\"zc is-compact figure-frame\"><i class=\"corner tl\"></i><i class=\"corner tr\"></i><i class=\"corner bl\"></i><i class=\"corner br\"></i>\n        <div class=\"zc-head\"><span class=\"zc-id\"><b>1</b> Ctrl</span></div>\n        <div class=\"zc-acts\"><button class=\"zc-btn is-primary is-wide\" type=\"button\">Basic Set</button></div>\n        <div class=\"zc-out ok\"><i></i>ACK</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"zc is-compact figure-frame\"><i class=\"corner tl\"></i><i class=\"corner tr\"></i><i class=\"corner bl\"></i><i class=\"corner br\"></i>\n        <div class=\"zc-head\"><span class=\"zc-id\"><b>2</b> Plug</span></div>\n        <div class=\"zc-acts\"><button class=\"zc-btn\" type=\"button\">On</button><button class=\"zc-btn\" type=\"button\">Off</button></div>\n        <div class=\"zc-out ok\"><i></i>On</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"zc is-compact figure-frame\"><i class=\"corner tl\"></i><i class=\"corner tr\"></i><i class=\"corner bl\"></i><i class=\"corner br\"></i>\n        <div class=\"zc-head\"><span class=\"zc-id\"><b>3</b> Remote</span></div>\n        <div class=\"zc-acts\"><button class=\"zc-btn is-wide\" type=\"button\">Report</button></div>\n        <div class=\"zc-out wait\"><i></i>Idle</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"zc is-compact figure-frame\"><i class=\"corner tl\"></i><i class=\"corner tr\"></i><i class=\"corner bl\"></i><i class=\"corner br\"></i>\n        <div class=\"zc-head\"><span class=\"zc-id\"><b>7</b> Lock</span></div>\n        <div class=\"zc-acts\"><button class=\"zc-btn\" type=\"button\">Wake</button></div>\n        <div class=\"zc-out wait\"><i></i>Asleep</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"zc is-compact figure-frame\"><i class=\"corner tl\"></i><i class=\"corner tr\"></i><i class=\"corner bl\"></i><i class=\"corner br\"></i>\n        <div class=\"zc-head\"><span class=\"zc-id\">Jammer</span></div>\n        <div class=\"zc-acts\"><div class=\"zc-seg\"><span>Off</span><span class=\"on\">Ch 0</span></div></div>\n        <div class=\"zc-out bad\"><i></i>Beaming</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"spec-label\" style=\"top: 492px;\">Frame log, compact <span>· 1104 × 432</span></div>\n    <div class=\"zn figure-frame\" style=\"position: absolute; left: var(--pad-x); top: 528px; width: 1104px; height: 432px;\"><i class=\"corner tl\"></i><i class=\"corner tr\"></i><i class=\"corner bl\"></i><i class=\"corner br\"></i>\n      <div class=\"zn-bar\"><span>Frame log · compact</span><span class=\"meta\">home id 0xe1f4a2c9 · jammer on</span></div>\n      <div class=\"zn-log\">\n        <div class=\"zn-hd zn-cols-mid\"><span>#</span><span>Path · direction</span><span>Frame</span><span>Speed</span><span>RSSI</span><span>Ch</span></div>\n        <div class=\"zn-r zn-cols-mid\">\n          <span class=\"zn-seq\">01</span>\n          <span class=\"zn-chain\"><span class=\"zn-nd tx\">1</span><span class=\"zn-hop\">→</span><span class=\"zn-nd rx\">2</span></span>\n          <span class=\"zn-type\">DATA</span><span class=\"sp sp-100\">100k</span>\n          <span class=\"rssi\"><b><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i></i></b>−54</span><span class=\"zn-ch\">0</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"zn-r zn-cols-mid\">\n          <span class=\"zn-seq\">02</span>\n          <span class=\"zn-chain\"><span class=\"zn-nd tx\">1</span><span class=\"zn-hop\">→</span><span class=\"zn-nd rx\">2</span></span>\n          <span class=\"zn-type\">DATA · retry</span><span class=\"sp sp-100\">100k</span>\n          <span class=\"rssi\"><b><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i></i><i></i></b>−55</span><span class=\"zn-ch\">0</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"zn-r zn-cols-mid\">\n          <span class=\"zn-seq\">03</span>\n          <span class=\"zn-chain\"><span class=\"zn-nd tx\">1</span><span class=\"zn-hop\">→</span><span class=\"zn-nd rx\">2</span></span>\n          <span class=\"zn-type\">DATA · retry</span><span class=\"sp sp-40\">40k</span>\n          <span class=\"rssi\"><b><i class=\"on\"></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></b>−71</span><span class=\"zn-ch\">1</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"zn-r zn-cols-mid is-ack\">\n          <span class=\"zn-seq\">04</span>\n          <span class=\"zn-chain\"><span class=\"zn-nd rx\">1</span><span class=\"zn-hop\">←</span><span class=\"zn-nd tx\">2</span></span>\n          <span class=\"zn-type is-ack\">ACK</span><span class=\"sp sp-40\">40k</span>\n          <span class=\"rssi\"><b><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i></i><i></i></b>−63</span><span class=\"zn-ch\">1</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"spec-label\" style=\"left: 1272px; top: 492px;\">Waterfall <span>· 528 × 432</span></div>\n    <div class=\"wf figure-frame\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 1272px; top: 528px; width: 528px; height: 432px;\"><i class=\"corner tl\"></i><i class=\"corner tr\"></i><i class=\"corner bl\"></i><i class=\"corner br\"></i>\n      <div class=\"wf-bar\"><span>rf-waterfall --band eu</span><span>span 8s</span></div>\n      <div class=\"wf-body\"><p>CLI output embedded here</p></div>\n      <div class=\"wf-axis\"><span>868.0</span><span>869.0</span><span>869.9 MHz</span></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"page-foot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n  </section>"
