  {
    "number": 18,
    "title": "Node control variants",
    "notes": "Control variants: one node detailed, two nodes, five compact. Outcome indicators at the bottom.",
    "html": "<section class=\"slide content\" data-screen-label=\"18\" data-label=\"Node control variants\" data-speaker-notes=\"Control variants: one node detailed, two nodes, five compact. Outcome indicators at the bottom.\">\n    <div class=\"board\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"corner tl\"></i><i class=\"corner tr\"></i><i class=\"corner bl\"></i><i class=\"corner br\"></i></div>\n    <div class=\"kicker k-right\">Reference · controls</div>\n    <h2 class=\"slide-title\">Node control variants</h2>\n\n    <div class=\"spec-label\" style=\"top: 324px;\">One node <span>· 528 × 216</span></div>\n    <div class=\"zc figure-frame\" style=\"position: absolute; left: var(--pad-x); top: 360px; width: 528px; height: 216px;\"><i class=\"corner tl\"></i><i class=\"corner tr\"></i><i class=\"corner bl\"></i><i class=\"corner br\"></i>\n      <div class=\"zc-head\"><span class=\"zc-id\"><b>2</b> Plug</span><span class=\"zc-role\">Binary switch</span></div>\n      <div class=\"zc-acts\">\n        <button class=\"zc-btn is-primary\" type=\"button\">On</button>\n        <button class=\"zc-btn\" type=\"button\">Off</button>\n        <div class=\"zc-seg\"><span class=\"on\">Supervision</span><span>Raw</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"zc-out ok\"><i></i>ACK <em>13 ms</em></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"spec-label\" style=\"left: 696px; top: 324px;\">Two nodes <span>· 1104 wide</span></div>\n    <div class=\"zgrid\" style=\"left: 696px; top: 360px; width: 1104px; height: 216px; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 528px);\">\n      <div class=\"zc figure-frame\"><i class=\"corner tl\"></i><i class=\"corner tr\"></i><i class=\"corner bl\"></i><i class=\"corner br\"></i>\n        <div class=\"zc-head\"><span class=\"zc-id\"><b>1</b> Controller</span><span class=\"zc-role\">Z-Wave JS</span></div>\n        <div class=\"zc-acts\">\n          <button class=\"zc-btn is-primary\" type=\"button\">Basic Set</button>\n          <button class=\"zc-btn\" type=\"button\">Ping</button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"zc-out wait\"><i></i>Pending <em>retry 2 / 3</em></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"zc figure-frame\"><i class=\"corner tl\"></i><i class=\"corner tr\"></i><i class=\"corner bl\"></i><i class=\"corner br\"></i>\n        <div class=\"zc-head\"><span class=\"zc-id\">Jammer</span><span class=\"zc-role\">Continuous beam</span></div>\n        <div class=\"zc-acts\">\n          <div class=\"zc-seg\"><span>Off</span><span class=\"on\">Ch 0</span><span>Ch 1</span><span>Ch 2</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"zc-out bad\"><i></i>Beaming <em>ch 0 · 868.4 MHz</em></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"spec-label\" style=\"top: 612px;\">Five nodes, compact <span>· 1680 wide, one row</span></div>\n    <div class=\"zgrid\" style=\"left: var(--pad-x); top: 648px; width: 1680px; height: 144px; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);\">\n      <div class=\"zc is-compact figure-frame\"><i class=\"corner tl\"></i><i class=\"corner tr\"></i><i class=\"corner bl\"></i><i class=\"corner br\"></i>\n        <div class=\"zc-head\"><span class=\"zc-id\"><b>1</b> Ctrl</span></div>\n        <div class=\"zc-acts\"><button class=\"zc-btn is-primary is-wide\" type=\"button\">Basic Set</button></div>\n        <div class=\"zc-out ok\"><i></i>ACK</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"zc is-compact figure-frame\"><i class=\"corner tl\"></i><i class=\"corner tr\"></i><i class=\"corner bl\"></i><i class=\"corner br\"></i>\n        <div class=\"zc-head\"><span class=\"zc-id\"><b>2</b> Plug</span></div>\n        <div class=\"zc-acts\"><button class=\"zc-btn\" type=\"button\">On</button><button class=\"zc-btn\" type=\"button\">Off</button></div>\n        <div class=\"zc-out ok\"><i></i>On</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"zc is-compact figure-frame\"><i class=\"corner tl\"></i><i class=\"corner tr\"></i><i class=\"corner bl\"></i><i class=\"corner br\"></i>\n        <div class=\"zc-head\"><span class=\"zc-id\"><b>3</b> Remote</span></div>\n        <div class=\"zc-acts\"><button class=\"zc-btn is-wide\" type=\"button\">Report</button></div>\n        <div class=\"zc-out wait\"><i></i>Idle</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"zc is-compact figure-frame\"><i class=\"corner tl\"></i><i class=\"corner tr\"></i><i class=\"corner bl\"></i><i class=\"corner br\"></i>\n        <div class=\"zc-head\"><span class=\"zc-id\"><b>7</b> Lock</span></div>\n        <div class=\"zc-acts\"><button class=\"zc-btn\" type=\"button\">Wake</button></div>\n        <div class=\"zc-out bad\"><i></i>No ACK</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"zc is-compact figure-frame\"><i class=\"corner tl\"></i><i class=\"corner tr\"></i><i class=\"corner bl\"></i><i class=\"corner br\"></i>\n        <div class=\"zc-head\"><span class=\"zc-id\">Jammer</span></div>\n        <div class=\"zc-acts\"><div class=\"zc-seg\"><span class=\"on\">Off</span><span>On</span></div></div>\n        <div class=\"zc-out wait\"><i></i>Ready</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"spec-label\" style=\"top: 852px;\">Outcome indicators</div>\n    <div style=\"position: absolute; left: var(--pad-x); top: 888px; width: 1680px; display: flex; gap: 72px; align-items: center;\">\n      <div class=\"zc-out ok\"><i></i>ACK <em>13 ms</em></div>\n      <div class=\"zc-out wait\"><i></i>Pending <em>retry 2 / 3</em></div>\n      <div class=\"zc-out bad\"><i></i>No ACK <em>3 tries, then reroute</em></div>\n      <div class=\"zc-out bad\"><i></i>Beaming <em>ch 0</em></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"page-foot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n  </section>"
  },
  {
    "number": 19,
    "title": "RF waterfall variants",
    "notes": "The waterfall is a dark terminal panel holding CLI output. It needs 2:1 or taller to read, so it sits beside the capture rather than under it.",
    "html": "<section class=\"slide content\" data-screen-label=\"19\" data-label=\"RF waterfall variants\" data-speaker-notes=\"The waterfall is a dark terminal panel holding CLI output. It needs 2:1 or taller to read, so it sits beside the capture rather than under it.\">\n    <div class=\"board\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"corner tl\"></i><i class=\"corner tr\"></i><i class=\"corner bl\"></i><i class=\"corner br\"></i></div>\n    <div class=\"kicker k-right\">Reference · waterfall</div>\n    <h2 class=\"slide-title\">RF waterfall, embedded CLI</h2>\n\n    <div class=\"spec-label\" style=\"top: 360px;\">Two modules <span>· 816 × 456, ratio 1.8 : 1</span></div>\n    <div class=\"wf figure-frame\" style=\"position: absolute; left: var(--pad-x); top: 396px; width: 816px; height: 456px;\"><i class=\"corner tl\"></i><i class=\"corner tr\"></i><i class=\"corner bl\"></i><i class=\"corner br\"></i>\n      <div class=\"wf-bar\"><span>rf-waterfall --band eu --span 8s</span><span>868.0–869.9 MHz</span></div>\n      <div class=\"wf-body\"><p>CLI output embedded here</p></div>\n      <div class=\"wf-axis\"><span>868.0</span><span>868.4</span><span>869.0</span><span>869.9 MHz</span></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"spec-label\" style=\"left: 984px; top: 360px;\">One module <span>· 384 × 456</span></div>\n    <div class=\"wf figure-frame\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 984px; top: 396px; width: 384px; height: 456px;\"><i class=\"corner tl\"></i><i class=\"corner tr\"></i><i class=\"corner bl\"></i><i class=\"corner br\"></i>\n      <div class=\"wf-bar\"><span>rf-waterfall</span><span>8s</span></div>\n      <div class=\"wf-body\"><p>CLI output embedded here</p></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"spec-label\" style=\"left: 1416px; top: 360px;\">Bare <span>· 384 × 456</span></div>\n    <div class=\"wf figure-frame\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 1416px; top: 396px; width: 384px; height: 456px;\"><i class=\"corner tl\"></i><i class=\"corner tr\"></i><i class=\"corner bl\"></i><i class=\"corner br\"></i>\n      <div class=\"wf-body\"><p>CLI output embedded here</p></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"zn-side\" style=\"left: var(--pad-x); top: 888px; width: 1680px; margin: 0;\">The CLI needs a 2 : 1 or taller box to show useful time depth, so the waterfall sits beside the capture rather than beneath it. Label and frequency axis are optional chrome — drop them and caption the box on the slide instead.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"page-foot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n  </section>"
  }
]
